OL,3,GNEWSAStormont budget offer increases to
OL,4,A#1.5bn, BBC understands
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC News NI understands that the
OL,7,Fgovernment's latest financial offer to
OL,8,Fthe Stormont executive now stands at
OL,9,F#1.5bn over the next three years.
OL,11,FOn Monday, Northern Ireland Secretary
OL,12,FSir Chris Bryant visited Stormont and
OL,13,Fmade an initial offer of #350m per year
OL,14,Fover the same period to help stabilise
OL,15,Fthe executive's finances - a #1.1bn
OL,16,Fpackage.
OL,18,FExecutive parties rejected that and
OL,19,Fsaid the government would need to
OL,20,Fincrease its contribution in order for
OL,21,FStormont to balance its books this
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
