OL,3,GNEWSAStormont budget offer increases to
OL,4,A#1.5bn, BBC understands
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is believed that the majority of the
OL,7,Fmoney for each year would be available
OL,8,Fto the executive for day-to-day
OL,9,F(resource) spending, with some money
OL,10,Frequired to be set aside for
OL,11,Flonger-term (capital) projects.
